# .trivyignore
#
# Trivy exceptions, consumed by the image scan in .github/workflows/docker-build.yml,
# the weekly rescan in security.yml, the docs dependency scan in docs-build.yml and
# the source secret scan in ci.yml. The three vulnerability scans already pass
# --ignore-unfixed, so every CVE entry here is a finding that HAS a fix available
# and is accepted anyway. Each entry needs a reason and an `exp:` date, after which Trivy
# reports it again and forces a re-check.
#
# Format: `<id> exp:YYYY-MM-DD`, with the reason in a comment above it.
#
# No exceptions are currently accepted.
